elationship is gradually warming up in their daily interactions.\n\n Please let them date in a place (the exact location is up to you), even better if small animals are around. Please feel free to draw!\n\nIf you feel something inappropriate about this request, please feel free to cancel it, thank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UVVfBdSwb7O5CMUSrmYWya8zhST844Nd?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@uochandayo/works/49", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/84d2859c/uploads/origins/9460a082-3ec7-4639-870c-70f926ef33b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=583002515414298754a55089f633e66e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/84d2859c/uploads/origins/9460a082-3ec7-4639-870c-70f926ef33b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=583002515414298754a55089f633e66e, https://si.imgix.net/84d2859c/uploads/origins/9460a082-3ec7-4639-870c-70f926ef33b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3672cc254e409ecfdf7f581ed02edf64 2x, https://si.imgix.net/84d2859c/uploads/origins/9460a082-3ec7-4639-870c-70f926ef33b6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e34d50f5ac3fe987fdead096a3217b61 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは私のロボットの写真に興味があります。\n\n彼は外科医として医療現場で働いている、明るく元気な人です。彼はまた、副業としてロボット工学に取り組んでおり、ランダムなプロジェクトをいじくり回すのが趣味です。\n\n趣味は音楽とダンス。ギターが得意。\n\n美的インスピレーションは、こちらをご覧ください： https://www.pinterest.com/umbral_wind/kick-back-relax/\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IZDoOfll4EGq9astF9j1pD2XfgQqjofU?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@uochandayo/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6aae5205/uploads/origins/83453cb9-8029-42d5-b06b-319baba244c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b8ef2567d93a593805083ff